<title>SINGAPORE: Parkway director sells 135,000 warrants.</title>
<headline>Parkway director sells 135,000 warrants.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parkway Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday one of its directors, Lim Cheok Peng, sold 135,000 of the company's warrants at Singapore $5.12 each.</p>
<p>The sale, representing 0.31 percent of its issued share capital, took place on May 30, 1997, a company statement said.</p>
<p>After the transaction, Lim holds 300,000 Parkway warrants, representing 0.689 percent of its issued capital.</p>
<p>Parkway warrants closed up two cents at S$5.00 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
